---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import DocsTopBar from '../components/DocsTopBar.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
---

<Base
  title="Support, Glyph"
  description="Get help with Glyph. Discord community, GitHub issues, support email, and answers to common problems."
>
  <DocsTopBar />
  <main class="support">
    <header class="support-header">
      <h1>Support</h1>
      <p>Bugs, questions, feature requests, here's how to reach us.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="support-channels">
      <a href="https://discord.gg/hvA2sMRwxC" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="support-card">
        <div class="support-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path
              d="M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Discord</h3>
        <p>
          The fastest way to get help. Real users, real-time. Recommended for general questions,
          troubleshooting, and chatting with other readers.
        </p>
        <span class="support-card-cta">Join the Discord →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="https://github.com/Glyph-moe" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="support-card">
        <div class="support-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path
              d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>GitHub Issues</h3>
        <p>
          Best for reproducible bugs, feature requests, and tracking work. Please search existing
          issues before opening a new one.
        </p>
        <span class="support-card-cta">Open an issue →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="mailto:contact@glyph.moe" class="support-card">
        <div class="support-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"
            ></path>
            <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Email</h3>
        <p>
          For private matters: privacy, security disclosures, App Store / TestFlight access, or
          anything you'd rather not discuss publicly.
        </p>
        <span class="support-card-cta">contact@glyph.moe →</span>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="support-block">
      <h2>Before you reach out</h2>
      <p>Many questions are already answered:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="/docs/getting-started">Getting Started</a>, install Glyph, add extensions,
          configure the reader
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/docs/faq">FAQ</a>, common questions about offline reading, privacy,
          customization
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/docs/sdk-debugging">Debugging Extensions</a>, for extension authors and
          contributors
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="support-block">
      <h2>Reporting a bug</h2>
      <p>To help us fix bugs quickly, include:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>iOS version and device model</li>
        <li>Glyph app version (Settings → About)</li>
        <li>Steps to reproduce</li>
        <li>What you expected to happen vs. what actually happened</li>
        <li>
          A diagnostic report (Settings → Share Diagnostic Report) if relevant, it contains logs and
          network history
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Diagnostic reports never leave your device unless you share them. They include app logs and
        network history but no personal data. See the
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for details.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="support-block">
      <h2>Feature requests</h2>
      <p>
        Open a GitHub issue with the <code>enhancement</code> label or post in the
        <code>#suggestions</code> channel of our Discord. We read everything; we just can't reply to everything.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="support-block">
      <h2>Security disclosures</h2>
      <p>
        If you've found a vulnerability, in the iOS app, the SDK, the CLI, or an official extension,
        please email <a href="mailto:contact@glyph.moe">contact@glyph.moe</a>
        directly rather than opening a public issue. We'll acknowledge within 72 hours.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="support-block">
      <h2>Building extensions?</h2>
      <p>
        Developer-specific help lives in <a href="/docs">the docs</a> and in the
        <code>#dev</code> channel on Discord. The
        <a href="/docs/sdk-debugging">Debugging guide</a> covers the most common issues authors run into.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .support {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 140px 24px 80px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .support-header {
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .support-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 48px);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-variation-settings:
      'SOFT' 30,
      'opsz' 144;
  }

  .support-header p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .support-channels {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 72px;
  }

  .support-card {
    display: block;
    padding: 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    transition: border-color 0.18s ease;
  }

  .support-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .support-card-icon {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .support-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .support-card p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .support-card-cta {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .support-block {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .support-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding-top: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .support-block p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .support-block ul {
    padding-left: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .support-block li {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .support-block a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--accent);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    transition: border-bottom-style 0.18s ease;
  }
  .support-block a:hover {
    border-bottom-style: solid;
  }

  .support-block code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    background: var(--bg-surface-hover);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .support {
      padding: 100px 16px 60px;
    }
    .support-header h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
